								<div class="title" id="post-title-3767357">
																		Pruning Post
															</div>
				<div class="info">
					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/leveritas" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1558990); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1558990&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609340669" alt="Leveritas" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1558990)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/leveritas" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1558990); return false;" >Leveritas</a></span> <span class="odate time_1523552773 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">12 Apr 2018 17:06</span>
														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-3767357">
									

<p>To set an example, I'm doing one early.</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;Moon&nbsp;rock</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;Close</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p><strong>Reason for pruning: Refining adds mass (cheese).</strong></p>
<p><strong>Name:</strong> Dr. McIntyre<br />
<strong>Date:</strong> 4/6/18<br />
<strong>Total Items:</strong> A rock from the Earth's moon.</p>
<p><strong>Input:</strong> One moon rock as mentioned above.<br />
<strong>Setting:</strong> 1:1<br />
<strong>Output:</strong> One block of cheddar cheese with the same shape and mass as the moon rock. Analysis of the block of cheese revealed that it was not only made of cow milk, but also of oxygen, silicon, magnesium, iron, calcium, and aluminum, which is what the Earth's moon is made out of.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;Laser&nbsp;Pointers</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;Close</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p><strong>Reason for pruning: If the output is exactly what you'd expect from the input, or if 914 has just obligingly improved everything you put in, the entry is out-of-character.</strong></p>
<p><strong>Name:</strong> Doctor L. Manning<br />
<strong>Date:</strong>4/13/2018<br />
<strong>Total Items:</strong> Twelve laser pointers, four green, four red and four blue</p>
<p><strong>Input:</strong> Three laser pointers. One blue, green and red<br />
<strong>Setting:</strong> 1.1<br />
