<blockquote>
<p>Like how they operate or the principles behind them?</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Input goes in one end, output comes out the other, like with any computer system. They are just abaci with more dimensions.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>Reading the entry you made, the changes 914 made the D-wave computers don't really make too much sense.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Read my post on janitor Kurt's attempt to untangle some cables. SCP-914 does not work <em>that</em> way.</p>
<blockquote>
<p><strong>EDIT</strong> After re-reading, forget what I said, the test log is pretty clever!</p>
</blockquote>
<p>I do my best.</p>

